{"id":"n91595-1-7","stage":5,"title":"좌우명 · 座右铭","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n91595-1-7-1","ko":"지수야, 너도 좌우명이 있어?","zh":"智秀，你也有座右铭吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"너도","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좌우명이","meaning":"座右铭","explanation":"좌우명：座右铭；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"좌우명","audio":"/audio/1b84f6e49bdfd52113c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91595","senseId":"1","lemma":"좌우명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"1b84f6e49bdfd521","term":"좌우명","zh":"座右铭","audio":"/audio/1b84f6e49bdfd52113c5.mp3","entryId":"91595","definition":"指人们时刻不忘地当作生活指南的格言。","pronunciation":["좌ː우명"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/0370655fc394fd777d4e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n91595-1-7-2","ko":"응, 난 '시간이 금이다'라는 말을 항상 명심하고 살지.","zh":"有啊，我总是牢记‘时间就是金钱’这句话来生活。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"난","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"'시간이","meaning":"光阴，时光","explanation":"시간：光阴，时光；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"5","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"금이다'라는","meaning":"金，金子，黄金","explanation":"금：金，金子，黄金；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。；라는：引用名词判断、名称或命令内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"금","audio":"/audio/d6f030e0b2b54ac203dc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36547","senseId":"1","lemma":"금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말을","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"항상","meaning":"总，总是，老，老是，经常","explanation":"항상：总，总是，老，老是，经常","readings":[{"term":"항상","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83162","senseId":"1","lemma":"항상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"명심하고","meaning":"铭记，记牢","explanation":"명심하다：铭记，记牢；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"명심하다","audio":"/audio/e4004a37c0a53518cd92.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55339","senseId":"1","lemma":"명심하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살지.","meaning":"生活，过活，过日子","explanation":"살다：生活，过活，过日子；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"2","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"光阴，时光","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"自然而然流逝的岁月。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"d6f030e0b2b54ac2","term":"금","zh":"金，金子，黄金","audio":"/audio/d6f030e0b2b54ac203dc.mp3","entryId":"36547","definition":"有着华丽光泽的黄色贵金属。","pronunciation":["금"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话，语言","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想法或感觉的行为或态度。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"f1d42a32366087dd","term":"항상","zh":"总，总是，老，老是，经常","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3","entryId":"83162","definition":"无论什么时候都没变地。","pronunciation":["항상"]},{"id":"e4004a37c0a53518","term":"명심하다","zh":"铭记，记牢","audio":"/audio/e4004a37c0a53518cd92.mp3","entryId":"55339","definition":"牢牢铭刻在心上，不忘记。","pronunciation":["명심하다"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"生活，过活，过日子","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"人过生活。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/219c9f262423d8e441aa.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.404,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=91595","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":163,"sequenceScore":3.2307,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["有啊，我总是牢记‘时间就是金钱’这句话来生活。","智秀，你也有座右铭吗？","听说敏俊赢了比赛？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["智秀，你也有座右铭吗？","听说敏俊赢了比赛？","有啊，我总是牢记‘时间就是金钱’这句话来生活。"],"answer":2}]}
